{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛くて素敵なもの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こう見えてとっても\nラブリーなものが好きなの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということでスイーツアーティストの\nKUNIKAさんという方の\n個展「voyage」に行ってきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/20/9765745/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく可愛いし\n胸がキュンとする。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/20/9765745/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピンクと水色の大きなケーキ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな素敵なケーキを目の前に出されたら\n幸せで泣いちゃうかも(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/20/9765745/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の一番好きだった空間(上)と\n私の一番好きなカップケーキ(下)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好き〜♡♡\n癒し〜♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/20/9765745/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリームの絞り方に感動して\nズームで撮ったケーキ(上)と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分へのお土産に買った\nポストカードとアイシングクッキー(下)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんとお土産コーナーもあるんだよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この素敵な可愛いクッキーを\n食べられちゃうんだよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛いポストカードやZINE、\n缶バッチまで置いてあるんだよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目がハートになりました。\n胸がワクワクでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は去年もKUNIKAさんの\n個展に行かせていただいたのですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年もまた素敵で素敵で。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"元々可愛いスイーツを\n更に更に可愛く、\n更に更に目が奪われるように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"変身させる魔法みたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく写真もチェックしているのですが\n全てが素敵で、\n発想や世界観に惚れ惚れしています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の好きなものを\n自分の好きなように\n変身させて人を魅了する。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に凄いです( ;o; )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も1人の表現者として\nもっともっと成長したい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしていつか一緒にお仕事できるように\nなりたいなと勝手に思ってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/20/9765745/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「voyage」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京でもまだやっているし\n全国でも開かれるので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛いものが好きな皆さん\n是非一度行ってみてはいかがでしょうか( ˘ω˘ )♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「有心論」RADWIMPSさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは本当名曲だと思う\nとっても歌詞が素敵。\n寂しげだけど力強くて\n胸に凄い響いてくる。\n特に好きな歌詞が\n「誰も端っこで泣かないようにと\n君は地球を丸くしたんだろ？」\nの部分。\nああ( ;o; )好き\n地球ってどうして丸いの？って\nいう質問があったら\n私はこの歌詞のまんま答えちゃうかも。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"王子姿がなかなか好評で\nとっても嬉しい(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリンシパルduexを思い出す！\n誠一役をよくやっていたな〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日もChihAnswerを\n募集します！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問待ってます\\( ˆoˆ )/\nたくさん待ってます\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}